                                "sense_id": "da5f7b8c-ae33-3540-93c9-ad522e9b6f45",
                                "text": "If the hour and the circumstance and the cause will but unite us, this unweaponed host will stretch away at once in majestic orders of tens of thousands--legions upon legions that would shame Xerxes for numbers and that first Caesar for strength."
                            },
                            {
